title: "Affordable Housing Analytics Toolkit (AHIP)"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-06
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Awediss"
    given-names: "Arshalouys"
abstract: >-
  A public-benefit housing analytics toolkit developed through the Affordable
  Housing Intelligence Platform (AHIP). It provides a nationally applicable
  decision-support framework, three nationwide housing dashboards, a separate
  Miami-Dade County permitting pilot, housing analytics reference materials,
  national replication guidance, data-quality controls, and responsible-AI
  and human-review safeguards.
keywords:
  - affordable housing
  - housing analytics
  - business intelligence
  - decision support
  - housing affordability
  - housing supply
  - permitting
  - responsible AI
  - Power BI
  - public data
